            "notes": "## HIGHLY RECOMMENDED\n- [Phoenix Protocol](item_460fb24b-8422-43bb-9964-d296ef7c086c) \n\n## COUNTER ITEMS\n-  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f): The best way for this round to repair your shield.\n\nHard Counter: [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54), [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05) trap, [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) \n\nSoft Counter: [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) ultimate,  [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) ultimate, [Sigma](hero_646d9571-c40a-4403-b6c1-fb67adb6112d), [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b), [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317), [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)\n\n- [Crusader\u2019s Cure](item_e89b853c-2441-432b-b4eb-20bc4b1b0619) \n\nHard Counter: [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) ultimate\n\nSoft Counter: [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) ultimate\n\n- [Ironclad Cleats](item_afb5c28e-3980-4a7d-85be-785c32217c28)\n\nHard Counter: [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85), [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05) boop, [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768) boop\n\n- [Overclocked Barrier](item_e82af99e-3116-4867-b8a4-52c7dfd1d7e9)\n\nSoft Counter: [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6), [Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0), [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b), [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05), [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424), [Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)\n\n- [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09): Good if the items above are not needed or if you have extra cash.\n\nSoft Counter: [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b), [Reaper](hero_0449752f-1c58-487b-b9a0-ca727d784457) \n\n## FILLER ITEMS\nTake in 